@.str.705 = private unnamed_addr constant [22 x i8] c"BOOST_TEST_LOG_FORMAT\00", align 1
@.str.706 = private unnamed_addr constant [428 x i8] c"Set the frameowrk's log format to one of the formats supplied by the framework. The only acceptable values for this parameter are the names of the output formats supplied by the framework. By default the framework uses human readable format (HRF) for testing log. This format is similar to compiler error format. Alternatively you can specify XML or JUNIT as log format, which are easier to process by testing automation tools.\00", align 1
